Kernel_supportsModule
├── given moduleTypeId is 0
│   └── it should return false
├── given moduleTypeId is 1 Validator
│   └── it should return true
├── given moduleTypeId is 2 Executor
│   └── it should return true
├── given moduleTypeId is 3 Fallback
│   └── it should return true
├── given moduleTypeId is 4 Hook
│   └── it should return true
├── given moduleTypeId is 5 Policy
│   └── it should return true
├── given moduleTypeId is 6 Signer
│   └── it should return true
└── given moduleTypeId is 7 or greater
    └── it should return false
